@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Deposit pesos: COMPLETED
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "CASH_IN", "amount": 50000}

### Withdraw within the available pesos: COMPLETED
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "CASH_OUT", "amount": 12500.50}

### Withdraw more than the available pesos: stored as REJECTED (201) with the reason
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "CASH_OUT", "amount": 1000000}

### A non-positive amount (400, nothing stored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "CASH_IN", "amount": 0}

### The user's transfers, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2/transfers

### The seed user's deposit, moved from the orders table
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/transfers/1

### Unknown user (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/999/transfers
